&lt;p&gt;What happens in the end?&lt;br&gt;
You’ll have to play it and find out.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;There are two endings.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;So go try it and see what kind of ending you get 😹&lt;/p&gt;

